NCT05454475.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria

* Age ≥ 18 years old;
* Gastrointestinal (GI) mucosal or submucosal lesions detected by general endoscopy;
* Require small-probe ultrasonic endoscopy (mEUS) under sedation for definitive diagnosis;
